## 5. Insights

- `spr.v6.b32`: 72% of the scalar add peak, 18% of the SIMD peak, 19% of the roofline (geomean). 2/20 points sit left of the ridge (DRAM-bound roof).
  - Far below every ceiling: neither DRAM bandwidth nor the add units are the limit. The time goes into latency: index loads, gathers, short loops with data-dependent trip counts (branch mispredicts).
- `spr.v7.b32`: 73% of the scalar add peak, 18% of the SIMD peak, 19% of the roofline (geomean). 2/20 points sit left of the ridge (DRAM-bound roof).
  - Far below every ceiling: neither DRAM bandwidth nor the add units are the limit. The time goes into latency: index loads, gathers, short loops with data-dependent trip counts (branch mispredicts).

